@startuml HeatingControlLogic
!include theme.puml

' File-local: the theme has no activity colours, so stock PlantUML draws light
' activity boxes and diamonds under the theme's white text.
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #4682B4
    BorderColor #ffffff
    FontColor #ffffff
    DiamondBackgroundColor #36648B
    DiamondBorderColor #ffffff
    DiamondFontColor #ffffff
}

title Heating Control Logic - HeatingControlTask\nWeather Compensation, Room Mode and Burner Request

start

:HeatingControlTask\n(5 s timer and control events);

if (Boiler and heating enabled?) then (no)
  :stopHeating() - clear HEATING_ON\nclearRequest(HEATING);
  stop
else (yes)
endif

if (PID autotune running?) then (yes)
  :Keep heating demand;
elseif (heatingOverrideOff set?) then (yes)
  :Heating not needed;
  stop
else (no)
  if (Weather-compensated control?) then (yes)
    :Needed when outside is below outsideThreshold\n(stops only at threshold + 1.0 °C)\nand the room is not overheated\n(stop above target + overheat margin,\nrestart below that limit - heating_hysteresis);
  else (room mode)
    :When off: start when room is below target\nWhen on: stop at room >= target + heating_hysteresis;
  endif
endif

if (Heating needed or HEATING_ON_OVERRIDE?) then (no)
  :If heating: stopHeating()\nclearRequest(HEATING);
  stop
else (yes)
endif

if (Water request active and WATER_PRIORITY set?) then (yes)
  :Defer heating\n(clear HEATING_ON_OVERRIDE);
  stop
else (no)
endif

:startHeating() - set HEATING_ON;

:Boiler target from the heating curve\n(room deviation shift in weather mode);
note right
  HeatingControlModuleFixedPoint:
  coefficients 1.4347, 0.021, 0.000248
  shift: heating/curveShift
  + room deviation x heating/roomCurveShiftFactor
  clamped to burner_low_limit (default 38 °C)
  .. heating_high_limit (default 75 °C)
end note

:BurnerRequestManager::setHeatingRequest(target)\nHEATING + POWER_LOW + target in bits 16-23;
note right
  Example: 70 °C = 0x00460001
  Power level HALF/FULL is decided
  by BoilerTempControlTask.
end note

:BurnerControlTask arms the heat demand\n(BurnerDemandGate);

stop

floating note right
  heating_hysteresis (default 0.5 °C):
  room mode starts below the target and stops
  at target + hysteresis; weather mode uses it
  for the room overheat restart limit.
  There is no static wasHeating flag - the task
  uses its current heating state.
end note

@enduml
